Equation Listing    SOLVE CARPRODUCTION Using LP From line 110


---- PROFITCARS  =E=  Total profit from producing cars ($) the objective function value

PROFITCARS..  - 6*W(Coups) - 7*W(Minivans) + CPROFIT =E= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- MATERIALCONSTRAINTS  =L=  Resources used to produce cars

MATERIALCONSTRAINTS(Labor)..  5*W(Coups) + 2.5*W(Minivans) =L= 17500 ; (LHS = 0)
     
MATERIALCONSTRAINTS(Metal)..  1000*W(Coups) + 2000*W(Minivans) =L= 4000000 ; (LHS = 0)
     
MATERIALCONSTRAINTS(CircuitBoards)..  4*W(Coups) + 3*W(Minivans) =L= 12000 ; (LHS = 0)
     
